    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Initiation 11 — The Sentence (Signature Mode).</strong> Stance. While The Sentence is held, every manifestation you sustain treats its primary target as <em>bound by name</em> — mechanical hook for holds, binds, and compelled-truth at the GM's table. Pays 1 Clarity per scene of upkeep against your Clarity.</p><p><span style=\"opacity: 0.7; font-size: 0.85em\">Discipline (mode <code>clSentence</code>): while ON, additional Reach discount −1 (stacks with Init 1 for a total of −2 on Blood-Debt-reach). Click this feature on the sheet to toggle the stance.</span></p><p><em>Pilot: lock exact upkeep curve and break condition after one playtest cycle.</em></p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"clMode\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Sentence</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Stance (signature)  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Action (open / drop)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Hold to bind primary targets of sustained manifestations by name (mechanical hook for holds, binds, compelled-truth). Pays 1 Clarity per scene of upkeep against Clarity.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
